gametitle=Xenosaga Episode I - Der Wille zur Macht (USA) [SLUS-20469] [6D1276AB]
// Always on. This file has no cheat checkbox. PCSX2 applies it on every launch
// while Enable Patches is on, which is the default.
// It only writes while the battle code is loaded, so the field and other modes stay as they are.
// Healing and EP costs are unchanged. A hit still does at least 1.
// The damage number on screen can still show the original value. The HP bar is the scaled one.
